  "title": "Stuffed Pork Loin",
  "description": "This stuffed pork loin recipe is perfect for Sunday dinner. A simple bread, celery, mushroom, and herb stuffing adds texture and flavor to roasted pork.",
  "authors": [
    "skinnychef"
  ],
